{"sha": "b58f2d8002bc8e24730abb213491d9950b1dd188be0928a65ed2b8e554dcf7b9", "body": ["\\textbf{12.} 若复数与某实点的距离不超过 $\\rho$，", "则其实部落在以 $c$ 为中心的区间 $\\intcc{c - \\rho}{c +", "\\rho}$ 中：将此结论应用于 $c = \\frac{2r^2}{1-r^2}$，$\\rho =", "\\frac{4r}{1-r^2}$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 对无零点的 $\\mathcal C^1$ 函数 $g$：", "$\\log\\abs g = \\frac12\\log(g\\bar g)$，故 $\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd", "t}\\log\\abs g = \\frac{g'\\bar g + g\\bar g'}{2\\abs g^2} =", "\\operatorname{Re}\\frac{g'}g$。令 $g(t) =", "f'(t\\eu^{\\iu\\theta})$（无零点：由单叶性），$g'(t) =", "\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}f''(t\\eu^{\\iu\\theta})$，于是在 $z =", "t\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd t}\\log\\bigl|f'(t\\eu^{\\iu\\theta})\\bigr|", "= \\operatorname{Re}\\Bigl(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}", "\\frac{f''}{f'}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac1t\\operatorname{Re}\\Bigl(z\\frac{f''}{f'}\\Bigr)", "\\in \\Bigl[\\frac{2t - 4}{1 - t^2},\\", "\\frac{2t + 4}{1 - t^2}\\Bigr]", "\\]", "由第 12 题（取半径 $t$）可得。由于 $\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd", "t}\\log\\frac{1+t}{(1-t)^3} = \\frac1{1+t} + \\frac3{1-t} =", "\\frac{2t+4}{1-t^2}$，且 $\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd", "t}\\log\\frac{1-t}{(1+t)^3} = \\frac{-1}{1-t} - \\frac3{1+t} =", "\\frac{2t-4}{1-t^2}$，在 $0$ 到 $r$ 上积分（三个", "函数在 $t = 0$ 处均为零，且 $f'(0) = 1$），得", "\\[", "\\log\\frac{1-r}{(1+r)^3} \\leq \\log\\abs{f'(z)} \\leq", "\\log\\frac{1+r}{(1-r)^3} :", "\\]", "取指数即得畸变定理。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 上界：沿线段 $[0, z]$，", "\\[", "\\abs{f(z)} = \\Bigl|\\int_0^rf'(t\\eu^{\\iu\\theta})", "\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}\\dd t\\Bigr|", "\\leq \\int_0^r\\frac{1+t}{(1-t)^3}\\dd t", "= \\frac{r}{(1-r)^2}", "\\]", "（$\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd t}\\frac t{(1-t)^2} = \\frac{1+t}{(1-t)^3}$）。", "下界：注意到 $\\frac r{(1+r)^2} < \\frac14$ 对 $r < 1$ 成立（因为", "$(1-r)^2 > 0$），故若 $\\abs{f(z)} \\geq \\frac14$，则", "无需证明。否则线段 $[0, f(z)]$ 位于", "$D(0, \\frac14) \\subseteq f(\\mathbb D)$ 中（第 7 题），且", "$\\gamma = f^{-1}\\circ[0, f(z)]$ 是 $\\mathcal C^1$ 路径，", "自 $0$ 到 $z$，位于 $\\mathbb D$ 中（$f^{-1}$ 全纯，", "见\\cref{cor:b3:residues:openmapping}）。代入 $w =", "f(\\zeta)$，", "\\[", "\\abs{f(z)} = \\int_{[0,f(z)]}\\abs{\\dd w}", "= \\int_\\gamma\\abs{f'(\\zeta)}\\,\\abs{\\dd\\zeta}", "\\geq \\int_0^1\\frac{1 - \\rho(s)}{(1 + \\rho(s))^3}", "\\,\\abs{\\gamma'(s)}\\,\\dd s", "\\]", "其中 $\\rho = \\abs\\gamma$，利用", "半径为 $\\rho(s)$ 处的下界畸变估计。由于 $\\abs{\\gamma'} \\geq \\rho'$", "（在有定义处成立；$\\rho$ 为 Lipschitz 函数），且被积函数中的", "因子为正，故", "\\[", "\\abs{f(z)} \\geq \\int_0^1", "\\frac{1 - \\rho(s)}{(1 + \\rho(s))^3}\\,\\rho'(s)\\,\\dd s", "= \\int_0^{r}\\frac{1 - u}{(1 + u)^3}\\,\\dd u", "= \\frac{r}{(1 + r)^2}", "\\]", "（$\\rho(0) = 0$，$\\rho(1) = r$；此代换只用到", "一个原函数，即 $\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd u}\\frac u{(1+u)^2} =", "\\frac{1-u}{(1+u)^3}$，而不需要单调性）。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $k'(z) = \\frac{\\dd}{\\dd z}\\,z(1 - z)^{-2} =", "\\frac{1 + z}{(1 - z)^3}$。当 $z = r$ 时：$k'(r) =", "\\frac{1+r}{(1-r)^3}$，$k(r) = \\frac r{(1-r)^2}$ --- 两者", "均取到上界。当 $z = -r$ 时：$k'(-r) =", "\\frac{1-r}{(1+r)^3}$，$\\abs{k(-r)} = \\frac r{(1+r)^2}$", "--- 两者均取到下界。Koebe 函数将", "其正实轴最大程度地拉伸至远处边界，并", "将对径射线最大程度地压向其割缝的", "尖端。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $\\abs{a_2} = 2$ 意味着 $\\abs{b_1} = 1$，对 $g(w)", "= 1/h(1/w) = w - \\frac{a_2}2w^{-1} + \\cdots$（第 4 题）；", "面积定理 $\\sum n\\abs{b_n}^2 \\leq 1$ 于是使", "其余所有系数为零：$g(w) = w + b_0 + \\eu^{\\iu\\alpha}/w$，其中", "$\\eu^{\\iu\\alpha} = -\\frac{a_2}2$。由于 $h$ 为奇函数，$g(-w) =", "1/h(-1/w) = -1/h(1/w) = -g(w)$：$g$ 为奇函数，故 $b_0 = 0$。", "取逆得 $h(z) = 1/g(1/z) = \\frac{z}{1 +", "\\eu^{\\iu\\alpha}z^2}$，再由 $f(z^2) = h(z)^2$ 得", "\\[", "f(w) = \\frac{w}{(1 + \\eu^{\\iu\\alpha}w)^2}", "= \\frac{w}{(1 - \\eu^{\\iu\\theta}w)^2}", "= \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}k\\bigl(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}w\\bigr),", "\\qquad \\eu^{\\iu\\theta} = -\\eu^{\\iu\\alpha} .", "\\]", "反之，每个旋转均有 $a_2 = 2\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$，其", "模为 $2$：Bieberbach 不等式的极值函数恰为", "旋转后的 Koebe 函数。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 若 $c$ 为被省略值，且 $\\abs c = \\frac14$：", "由第 6 题，存在 $F \\in \\mathcal S$，使 $A_2 = a_2 +", "\\frac1c$，故 $\\frac1c = A_2 - a_2$，且", "\\[", "4 = \\Bigl|\\frac1c\\Bigr| = \\abs{A_2 - a_2}", "\\leq \\abs{A_2} + \\abs{a_2} \\leq 2 + 2 = 4 :", "\\]", "处处取等，特别地 $\\abs{a_2} = 2$。由", "第 16 题，$f = \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}k(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}\\cdot)$，", "其被省略值集合为 $\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}", "\\intoc{-\\infty}{-\\frac14}$：", "模为 $\\frac14$ 的唯一的被省略值为 $c = -\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}/4$。（验算：", "$a_2 = 2\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$，$\\frac1c = -4\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$，", "故 $A_2 = -2\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} = -a_2$：三角不等式", "以反向对齐的方式取等，这是必然的。）", ""]}